WEBVTT

00:00:16.521 --> 00:00:19.089
Strange...

00:00:19.089 --> 00:00:21.222
I've never seen spiders
act like that.

00:00:21.222 --> 00:00:22.440
I don't like spiders.

00:00:27.271 --> 00:00:28.229
What's that?

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:35.410
"The Chamber of Secrets
has been opened.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.455
Enemies of the Heir, beware."

00:00:37.455 --> 00:00:39.414
It's written in blood.

00:00:43.069 --> 00:00:45.246
Oh, no.

00:00:49.946 --> 00:00:52.688
It's Filch's cat.

00:00:52.688 --> 00:00:56.257
It's Mrs. Norris.

00:01:10.488 --> 00:01:12.403
"Enemies of the Heir, beware."

00:01:15.145 --> 00:01:17.408
You'll be next, Mudbloods.

00:01:17.408 --> 00:01:18.931
What's going on here?

00:01:18.931 --> 00:01:20.890
Go on, make way, make way.

00:01:23.806 --> 00:01:24.981
Potter...

00:01:26.548 --> 00:01:28.767
What are you...?

00:01:30.813 --> 00:01:32.684
Mrs. Norris?

00:01:35.731 --> 00:01:37.820
You've...murdered my cat.

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:39.648
No. No.

00:01:39.648 --> 00:01:41.302
I'll kill you.

00:01:43.478 --> 00:01:44.740
I'll kill you!

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:46.437
DUMBLEDORE:
Argus?

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:50.180
Argus, I--

00:01:51.877 --> 00:01:53.923
Everyone...

00:01:53.923 --> 00:01:56.665
will proceed to
their dormitories immediately.

00:01:56.665 --> 00:01:59.363
Everyone except...

00:01:59.363 --> 00:02:00.973
you three.

00:02:03.715 --> 00:02:05.674
BOY: Ravenclaws,
follow me.

00:02:08.981 --> 00:02:10.766
She's not dead, Argus.

00:02:10.766 --> 00:02:12.942
She has been Petrified.

00:02:12.942 --> 00:02:14.160
Ah, thought so.

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:16.554
So unlucky I wasn't there.

00:02:16.554 --> 00:02:19.340
I know exactly the countercurse
that could've spared her.

00:02:22.517 --> 00:02:24.345
But how she's been Petrified
I cannot say.

00:02:24.345 --> 00:02:25.433
Ask him.

00:02:25.433 --> 00:02:27.348
It's him
that's done it.

00:02:27.348 --> 00:02:29.350
You saw
what he wrote on the wall.

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:33.179
It's not true, sir.
I swear.

00:02:33.179 --> 00:02:34.442
I never touched
Mrs. Norris.

00:02:34.442 --> 00:02:37.053
Rubbish.

00:02:37.053 --> 00:02:38.533
If I might, headmaster?

00:02:38.533 --> 00:02:40.578
Perhaps Potter and his friends

00:02:40.578 --> 00:02:42.841
were simply in the wrong place
at the wrong time.

00:02:44.452 --> 00:02:45.670
However...

00:02:46.758 --> 00:02:50.501
the circumstances
are suspicious.

00:02:50.501 --> 00:02:55.201
I, for one, don't recall
seeing Potter at dinner.

00:02:55.201 --> 00:02:56.899
I'm afraid that's
my doing, Severus.

00:02:56.899 --> 00:03:00.163
You see, Harry was helping me
answer my fan mail.

00:03:00.163 --> 00:03:04.341
That's why Ron and I
went looking for him, professor.

00:03:04.341 --> 00:03:07.213
We'd just found him
when he said...

00:03:09.302 --> 00:03:11.174
Yes, Miss Granger?

00:03:11.174 --> 00:03:13.263
When I said
I wasn't hungry.

00:03:14.569 --> 00:03:16.222
We were heading
back to the common room

00:03:16.222 --> 00:03:17.398
when we found
Mrs. Norris.

00:03:21.314 --> 00:03:23.665
Innocent until proven guilty,
Severus.

00:03:23.665 --> 00:03:26.581
My cat
has been Petrified.

00:03:26.581 --> 00:03:29.801
I want to see some punishment!

00:03:29.801 --> 00:03:34.415
We will be able to cure her,
Argus.

00:03:34.415 --> 00:03:36.112
As I understand it,

00:03:36.112 --> 00:03:37.679
Madame Sprout

00:03:37.679 --> 00:03:39.463
has a very healthy growth
of Mandrake.

00:03:39.463 --> 00:03:41.813
When matured,
a potion will be made,

00:03:41.813 --> 00:03:43.554
which will revive
Mrs. Norris.

00:03:43.554 --> 00:03:45.600
And in the meantime...

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:49.995
I strongly recommend caution...

00:03:49.995 --> 00:03:51.736
to all.

